DelegateOnFirstReceipt_ShareClass_Unit_Concrete_Test
├── when the receiver has no delegate and receives shares
│   └── it should delegate the receiver to themselves
├── when the receiver already delegated to someone
│   └── it should keep that delegate
├── when the receiver is the Safe
│   └── it should leave the Safe with no delegate
└── when the receiver is the zero address
    └── it should do nothing
